    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfeb <strong>Academy Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live your own story. Shape the world. Build relationships. Or burn them.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 About the Game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academy Life</strong> is a text-based life simulation RPG set in a dynamic open world where your choices matter.<br>Play as a student entering a complex social environment \u2014 or drop out and forge your own path in a bustling city full of unpredictable events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new game session generates a unique world, filled with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>60 to 400 fully simulated NPCs</strong>, each with their own personality, preferences, memories, and relationships;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 A <strong>living city</strong> with over <strong>50 distinct locations</strong>, from quiet parks and universities to shady alleyways and industrial zones;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Richly layered <strong>storylines</strong>, shaped by your choices and the shifting dynamics of the characters around you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Randomized world generation</strong> \u2013 Every playthrough is different, with a new social structure and character dynamics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Interactive NPCs</strong> \u2013 Become friends, rivals, romantic partners \u2014 or enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <strong>Academic &amp; urban sandbox</strong> \u2013 Run your own club, build a business, take a job, or just explore life beyond the academy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Branching narratives</strong> \u2013 Solve local mysteries, intervene in NPC drama, or follow structured plotlines across the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Fully simulated social world</strong> \u2013 NPCs act, react, and evolve, with or without your involvement. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfeb <strong>Academy Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live your own story. Shape the world. Build relationships. Or burn them.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 About the Game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academy Life</strong> is a text-based life simulation RPG set in a dynamic open world where your choices matter.<br>Play as a student entering a complex social environment \u2014 or drop out and forge your own path in a bustling city full of unpredictable events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new game session generates a unique world, filled with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>60 to 400 fully simulated NPCs</strong>, each with their own personality, preferences, memories, and relationships;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 A <strong>living city</strong> with over <strong>50 distinct locations</strong>, from quiet parks and universities to shady alleyways and industrial zones;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Richly layered <strong>storylines</strong>, shaped by your choices and the shifting dynamics of the characters around you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Randomized world generation</strong> \u2013 Every playthrough is different, with a new social structure and character dynamics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Interactive NPCs</strong> \u2013 Become friends, rivals, romantic partners \u2014 or enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <strong>Academic &amp; urban sandbox</strong> \u2013 Run your own club, build a business, take a job, or just explore life beyond the academy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Branching narratives</strong> \u2013 Solve local mysteries, intervene in NPC drama, or follow structured plotlines across the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Fully simulated social world</strong> \u2013 NPCs act, react, and evolve, with or without your involvement. </p></li></ul>",
